50 Days • 50 Tech Thoughts

Technology isn't just algorithms and code.

It's logic carrying emotions,
systems carrying stories,
and innovation hiding a little poetry.

For the next 50 days I will write one original tech-inspired thought, quote, or poem every day — turning concepts from the world of technology into ideas that feel a little more human

The journey will explore:

* Programming
* Artificial Intelligence
* Cloud Computing
* Databases
* Cyber Security
* Computer Networks
* Operating Systems
* The Internet
* Human emotions through technology

Because sometimes, a database can teach us about memory,
a network can teach us about connection,
and an algorithm can teach us about choices.

50 days. 50 thoughts. 
One idea:
Technology has logic. But perhaps, it has poetry too.

